  "title": {
    "zh": "儿童堡垒帐篷拼搭积木套装",
    "en": "Kids Fort Tent Building Set"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款面向儿童创意拼搭与亲子互动的堡垒帐篷积木套装，采用杆件与连接球组合，可用于家庭、课堂和活动空间中的快速造型搭建。",
    "en": "This is a kids fort-tent building set designed for creative construction and parent-child interaction."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "这是一款面向儿童创意拼搭与亲子互动的堡垒帐篷积木套装，采用杆件与连接球组合，可用于家庭。",
      "该款儿童堡垒帐篷拼搭积木套装采用插珠式拼接结构，支持孩子自由组合搭建帐篷，城堡和主题空间。",
      "产品以塑料/塑胶材质为主，强调可重复拆装和形态变换，适合用于课堂活动，节庆布景和儿童活动区陈列。",
      "关键参数包括产品类型儿童堡垒帐篷拼搭玩具、材质塑料/塑胶、拼砌玩具类型其它。",
      "包装参数支持包装方式彩盒、包装体积(cm³)17204。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This is a kids fort-tent building set designed for creative construction and parent-child interaction.",
      "This kids fort-tent set uses a bead-and-rod connection design, allowing children to build tents, castles, and themed spaces freely.",
      "The product is mainly made of plastic and supports repeated assembly and shape transformation, making it suitable for classroom activities.",
      "Key specs include Product Type: Kids Fort Tent Building Toy; Material: Plastic; Construction Type: Other Construction Type.",
      "Packaging supports Packaging: Color Box; Package Volume (cm³): 17204."
    ]
  },
